cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or discuss this research, please cite the repository release
  using the metadata below. A DOI will be added after Zenodo registration.
type: generic
title: 'Musical Structural Intelligence and Open-Ended Evolution (MSI-OEE)'
abstract: >-
  A theory-first research framework for musical structural intelligence,
  including musical UIERUs, structural relay, romantic intelligence,
  perspective-aware scoring, musical distance and OTHERS, open-ended
  structural evolution, and human–AI musical co-evolution. The initial
  release provides research papers, cases, specifications, hypotheses,
  and a validation roadmap; it does not claim an implemented runtime
  or experimentally validated results.
